{"text": "To reach the target of 24 using the numbers [3, 4, 8, 11] exactly once with the operations +, -, *, /, we can follow these steps:", "start": 0, "end": 129, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "1. Start by considering the numbers and the possible operations.", "start": 131, "end": 195, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. One effective way to approach this is to use division to get a smaller number and then multiply to reach 24.", "start": 197, "end": 308, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. We can try the following expression:", "start": 310, "end": 349, "label": "inform"}
