{"text": "- Finally, subtract from 11: 11 - 6 = 5.", "start": 469, "end": 509, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "5. However, this does not give us 24.", "start": 511, "end": 548, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try another approach:", "start": 549, "end": 576, "label": "suggest"}
