{"text": "- Then, divide by 3: (32/3) = (32/3) approx 10.67.", "start": 669, "end": 719, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Finally, add to 11: 11 + (32/3) = (33 + 32/3) = (65/3) approx 21.67.", "start": 720, "end": 790, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "7. This is still not 24.", "start": 792, "end": 816, "label": "inform"}
